{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/placeholder-gameplay.gif?t=1744288605\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top! is a local-multiplayer arena shooter/brawler where players inside of a fish-mechs try to eliminate each other. Charge up and shoot bubbles, jump, evade, and knock your friends out to be the last fish standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f0 Small, procedurallay generated levels to knock your friends out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Charming and colorful fish-mechs to control!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Play with up to 8 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udee7 Bubble turrets to add chaos to the fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Attention: This game is digestible\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\ude0b\ud83c\udf74</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome. We want you to be able to finish our games in just a couple of sessions\u2014without ever making you feel stuffed, so to say.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511970?t=1744288605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511970?t=1744288605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/1017503fa0f2bfab0a4ab0acf4f6434135940cad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744288605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app